mode: .id beast .bark_override_id str_beast_bark .affliction_combat_skill_id transform .battle_complete_combat_skill_id transform .stress_damage_per_turn 6
// ABO-016: Upkeep stays 6 per actual beast stress application; no new upkeep increase is needed for 12/5/3 redistribution.
// ABO-010 야수 유지 스트레스4→6: 진입15+실제 유지 적용횟수×6으로 장기 유지의 대가를 본인이 진다.
// ABO-004 [trace 2026-10-05] Keep accumulating stress as the cost of prolonged beast form.
// ABO-004 beast: stress per turn 6 -> 4; prolonged beast form still adds stress.
